WEBVTT

00:07.424 --> 00:09.426
[opening theme music playing]

00:12.220 --> 00:13.847
[wind gusting]

00:37.620 --> 00:42.000
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE 2

00:46.588 --> 00:47.505
[Seung-jo] Ho-jae.

00:49.049 --> 00:50.675
Why do you bother fighting them?

00:52.260 --> 00:53.803
You know that you can't win in the end.

00:55.472 --> 00:57.223
I'm not fighting to win, Seung-jo.

00:57.307 --> 00:59.142
[wistful music playing]

00:59.225 --> 01:00.935
It's my way of getting revenge.

01:02.062 --> 01:04.731
As long as we fight,
they will never forget

01:06.441 --> 01:08.443
everything that they did to us and more.

01:09.027 --> 01:09.944
As long as we're alive…

01:12.280 --> 01:13.656
we'll make them feel sorry.

01:14.657 --> 01:16.576
And if they don't feel any remorse,

01:18.119 --> 01:20.246
then we'll continue
to wreak havoc on them.

01:22.499 --> 01:24.501
And if that doesn't work, then we will

01:26.252 --> 01:28.129
continue to be a nuisance anyway.

01:29.547 --> 01:30.757
We'll make them suffer.

01:32.926 --> 01:35.053
They can never run away
from what they did.

01:36.888 --> 01:38.431
Any chance for forgiveness?

01:39.140 --> 01:42.185
How can I forgive
if they don't feel the need to apologize?

01:42.268 --> 01:45.730
They refuse to admit the horrible things
they did, then say it never happened.

01:46.564 --> 01:48.942
So I don't think
forgiveness is on the table for me.

01:50.235 --> 01:51.277
If you say so.

01:52.779 --> 01:54.280
However, have you considered

01:55.865 --> 01:57.450
it was a different time back then?

01:59.327 --> 02:00.286
Yeah, sure.

02:01.329 --> 02:02.580
It was a different time.

02:03.456 --> 02:07.043
I understand it was a time of war
and everyone was trying to survive it.

02:08.878 --> 02:09.712
However,

02:10.839 --> 02:13.633
as human beings,
we know when what we're doing is inhumane

02:13.716 --> 02:14.968
and has crossed a line.

02:17.137 --> 02:19.097
And if we don't hold those accountable…

02:21.516 --> 02:23.434
then the world gets that much darker.

02:25.311 --> 02:26.646
How much do you trust me?

02:26.729 --> 02:27.605
[chuckles]

02:28.231 --> 02:30.358
Well, it's not about how much I trust you.

02:31.192 --> 02:32.527
You're trustworthy or not.

02:35.071 --> 02:35.947
[Seung-jo] I wish

02:37.073 --> 02:39.075
I never met you in the first place.

02:41.286 --> 02:42.287
If I hadn't,

02:43.454 --> 02:46.958
I would've been perfectly fine
with becoming a monster.

02:51.921 --> 02:53.464
[hissing]

02:55.508 --> 02:58.136
[Chae-ok groaning]

02:58.219 --> 03:00.221
- [melancholy music playing]
- [panting]

03:01.139 --> 03:02.682
[panting]

03:04.851 --> 03:06.311
Why are you doing this?

03:06.394 --> 03:07.645
I told you.

03:09.981 --> 03:11.065
I really don't want to die.

03:14.903 --> 03:15.862
[footsteps approaching]

03:22.660 --> 03:26.080
[Seung-jo] Ho-jae helped me
entertain a dream for a while.

03:39.844 --> 03:40.678
[gasps]

03:40.762 --> 03:42.889
[Seung-jo] I thought,
"Maybe I could live like him too."

03:45.183 --> 03:46.476
Like a real person.

03:47.060 --> 03:48.603
As a human would.

03:49.854 --> 03:50.897
Turns out…

03:52.941 --> 03:54.025
that I couldn't.

03:56.319 --> 03:57.570
I really am a monster.

03:59.447 --> 04:02.116
I almost never care
what happens to anyone but myself.

04:02.617 --> 04:04.369
I never feel guilt about it either.

04:05.870 --> 04:07.205
If something threatens me,

04:07.288 --> 04:08.998
then I kill it without hesitation.

04:09.082 --> 04:10.792
If I'm bored, I hunt.

04:11.292 --> 04:12.961
If I am hungry, then I feed.

04:16.256 --> 04:17.215
To think of it…

04:20.218 --> 04:21.636
there really is no better thrill.

04:25.306 --> 04:27.308
Your mother was Akiko, wasn't she?

04:29.352 --> 04:30.353
Do you even know…

04:33.606 --> 04:35.275
how your mother was killed?

04:38.903 --> 04:39.904
Yes.

04:39.988 --> 04:41.322
[music intensifies]

04:52.917 --> 04:53.918
[Seung-jo] What about it?

04:55.003 --> 04:56.963
All that's in the past now. Who cares?

04:58.381 --> 05:02.135
The only mother I know is
Lady Maeda, who raised me.

05:03.594 --> 05:04.804
[gasps softly]

05:04.887 --> 05:07.098
You don't think she's been using you?

05:10.768 --> 05:12.687
[melancholy music continues]

05:12.770 --> 05:15.273
A good son
answers his mother with a "yes."

05:20.361 --> 05:21.779
[Seung-jo] You still don't get it.

05:21.863 --> 05:23.740
I was the one who was using her.

05:25.283 --> 05:26.617
It's how I survived.

05:30.079 --> 05:30.997
And now…

05:31.622 --> 05:33.374
[squelching]

05:35.126 --> 05:36.336
…you will die.

05:36.919 --> 05:38.755
I want you to bring me that woman.

05:39.756 --> 05:40.840
Yoon Chae-ok.

05:41.549 --> 05:42.508
For Ho-jae's sake…

05:42.592 --> 05:44.385
[Maeda] It must be
Master Jang who does it.

05:44.969 --> 05:46.804
He is to take her life in the very end.

05:46.888 --> 05:48.306
…I have to kill you.

05:49.182 --> 05:50.433
- [squelching]
- [gunshot]

05:52.018 --> 05:52.935
[gasps softly]

05:53.019 --> 05:55.313
[mysterious music playing]

05:55.396 --> 05:57.398
[Ji-su] Freeze! Move, and I'll shoot!

05:57.482 --> 05:58.358
[pants]

06:02.403 --> 06:03.905
[panting]

06:03.988 --> 06:05.114
[groans in pain]

06:05.907 --> 06:07.742
- [squelching]
- [groaning in pain]

06:07.825 --> 06:10.286
[Seung-jo panting]

06:13.373 --> 06:15.750
Master Jang will be
very disappointed when he…

06:18.002 --> 06:20.129
learns you've become a monster.

06:26.094 --> 06:27.762
Wait a minute. That person, he's…

06:27.845 --> 06:29.347
[Ji-su panting]

06:30.765 --> 06:32.308
- [footsteps approaching]
- [screeching]

06:34.936 --> 06:36.229
[screeching snarl]

06:37.980 --> 06:39.607
And who are the men in black?

06:40.733 --> 06:43.277
You have to run, or else you're gonna die.

06:44.821 --> 06:46.823
- What are you doing here?
- [snarling]

06:48.825 --> 06:50.118
[groaning]

06:51.285 --> 06:52.662
[screeching snarl]

06:52.745 --> 06:54.372
[breathing heavily]

06:56.249 --> 06:57.333
- [Chae-ok grunts]
- Hey!

06:57.417 --> 06:59.502
Get as far away as you can. Hurry.

07:00.795 --> 07:02.380
- [tense music playing]
- [Chae-ok grunts]

07:03.005 --> 07:04.465
- [blade rasping]
- [Chae-ok grunts]

07:04.549 --> 07:05.550
[Ji-su gasps]

07:10.763 --> 07:11.681
[tires squeal]

07:13.474 --> 07:14.684
[tense music continues]

07:14.767 --> 07:15.810
[tires squeal]

07:15.893 --> 07:17.937
- [Chae-ok grunts]
- [blade slices]

07:19.230 --> 07:20.648
- [blade slicing]
- [squelching]

07:22.984 --> 07:24.986
[snarling]

07:27.530 --> 07:28.781
[grunting]

07:34.078 --> 07:35.621
- [music intensifies]
- [clank echoes]

07:39.333 --> 07:40.293
[squelching]

07:46.090 --> 07:47.008
[grunts]

07:49.385 --> 07:50.470
[screeching snarl]

07:50.553 --> 07:52.847
[panting]

08:08.529 --> 08:10.531
[grunting]

08:13.951 --> 08:15.328
What are you doing?

08:15.912 --> 08:17.413
Who sent you here?

08:25.087 --> 08:26.255
[thud echoes]

08:27.256 --> 08:28.257
[grunting]

08:37.475 --> 08:38.851
[music subsides]

08:38.935 --> 08:41.395
[ominous music playing]

08:42.104 --> 08:42.939
[pants]

08:49.820 --> 08:50.655
[sighs]

08:52.657 --> 08:55.743
Your odds of winning at this point
are impossible.

08:57.203 --> 08:58.371
You wanna bet on that?

09:02.291 --> 09:04.126
There's only one way to find out.
You ready?

09:10.633 --> 09:11.759
No matter what you do,

09:11.842 --> 09:14.637
Lady Maeda is going to end up
killing everyone around you.

09:16.347 --> 09:19.016
Because ultimately,
the thing that she really wants

09:19.559 --> 09:21.394
is for you to be all alone.

09:25.273 --> 09:27.400
If you want to know
my opinion in all this,

09:27.483 --> 09:29.235
I don't actually care who wins in the end.

09:29.318 --> 09:31.737
I'm just waiting
for the fight to be over with.

09:35.199 --> 09:36.659
And if you hope to win,

09:37.743 --> 09:39.328
wouldn't that come in handy?

09:39.412 --> 09:41.414
[dramatic string music playing]

09:43.749 --> 09:44.875
[loud thud]

09:45.793 --> 09:47.795
- [loud thud]
- [creature snarls]

09:49.171 --> 09:50.548
[snarls]

09:50.631 --> 09:54.552
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN BENEVOLENCE AND EXPLOITATION

09:54.635 --> 09:58.556
EPISODE 7
MARGINAL MAN

09:59.307 --> 10:01.309
[music fades]

10:03.728 --> 10:05.563
[Yong-gil] Please have mercy on him,
Lady Maeda.

10:05.646 --> 10:08.566
Please have mercy on Ho-jae once more.

10:09.609 --> 10:10.484
I beg you.

10:10.985 --> 10:13.070
- [intriguing music playing]
- I swear I'll watch him.

10:13.154 --> 10:17.450
I'll… I'll make sure that he never appears
in front of you again, Lady Maeda.

10:17.950 --> 10:18.951
I beg you.

10:19.035 --> 10:21.203
I can make sure he doesn't do anything.

10:22.872 --> 10:25.916
Uh, one more chance.
Please have mercy on him.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.335
Are you willing

10:29.045 --> 10:30.921
to bet your own life on that promise?

10:41.098 --> 10:42.058
I swear to you.

10:43.059 --> 10:44.226
Just let Ho-jae live.

10:46.020 --> 10:46.896
I will

10:47.897 --> 10:48.898
do what you ask.

10:50.608 --> 10:53.027
[footsteps approaching]

10:54.654 --> 10:55.863
[door squeaks]

11:01.786 --> 11:02.620
Ho-jae.

11:14.298 --> 11:15.257
[sighs]

11:18.803 --> 11:20.137
[exhales]

11:21.639 --> 11:22.473
Ho-jae.

11:24.350 --> 11:25.685
Ho-jae, let's go.

11:25.768 --> 11:28.020
Let's go. Let's go home now.

11:28.104 --> 11:29.188
Huh? Ho-jae.

11:29.271 --> 11:31.649
[sobbing]

11:31.732 --> 11:33.442
Let's go, okay? Let's go.

11:33.526 --> 11:34.652
Let's go home, Ho-jae.

11:35.736 --> 11:36.862
Let's go home now.

11:36.946 --> 11:38.864
[somber music playing]

11:39.365 --> 11:40.491
[inhales]

11:41.909 --> 11:42.868
[exhales]

11:43.869 --> 11:45.788
[music subsides]

11:45.871 --> 11:48.791
[monitor beeping]

11:55.923 --> 11:57.550
Yeah, got it. I'll be over there soon.

11:58.551 --> 11:59.760
[disconnect tone]

12:01.554 --> 12:04.056
No, you can stay here. I can go on my own.

12:04.140 --> 12:05.349
What? Where are you going?

12:05.433 --> 12:08.686
Kwon Yong-gil is awake
and asking for me. It'll be quick.

12:11.731 --> 12:12.565
[door opens]

12:24.910 --> 12:26.328
[phone buzzing]

12:26.412 --> 12:28.080
DETECTIVE NOH JI-SU

12:28.164 --> 12:30.374
Detective Noh. How's it going so far?

12:31.459 --> 12:33.461
[clattering playing on phone]

12:34.003 --> 12:34.837
Captain Yuh?

12:35.755 --> 12:37.131
[hissing]

12:37.757 --> 12:38.758
Captain Yuh?

12:40.092 --> 12:41.135
Captain Yuh!

12:42.511 --> 12:44.513
[stirring music playing]

12:47.349 --> 12:48.392
[phone buzzes]

12:51.020 --> 12:52.062
What is it?

12:52.146 --> 12:54.774
[man] Lady Maeda seems
to have caught on to the plan.

12:56.400 --> 12:58.402
[music intensifies]

13:16.003 --> 13:18.005
[stirring music continues]

13:56.752 --> 13:58.754
[suspenseful music playing]

14:12.059 --> 14:13.477
[music intensifies]

14:27.324 --> 14:29.326
[music fades]

14:34.957 --> 14:36.000
Welcome back.

14:37.626 --> 14:38.836
I've been waiting for you.

14:58.105 --> 15:00.107
I was wondering why
it was so empty on the way here.

15:00.900 --> 15:04.528
Well, for an old friend like you,
it was the least I could do.

15:05.529 --> 15:06.864
Oh, we're still friends, are we?

15:06.947 --> 15:09.033
A lot has changed over the years.

15:09.533 --> 15:10.993
And despite everything that happened,

15:11.076 --> 15:14.747
we still always find ourselves
standing face-to-face.

15:16.040 --> 15:17.499
So perhaps we are.

15:22.254 --> 15:23.923
Perhaps that is why…

15:36.518 --> 15:39.229
it is better to remember
even the most painful

15:40.648 --> 15:43.275
of memories than to be completely alone.

15:45.444 --> 15:48.072
With the kind of memories
I had of you way back then,

15:49.490 --> 15:51.992
I think you're quite lucky
that I didn't remember.

15:52.868 --> 15:54.411
Well, I believe otherwise.

15:55.871 --> 15:58.874
I still think it is better for you
to remember everything

16:00.167 --> 16:01.251
than to live with a void.

16:01.835 --> 16:04.088
I used to think you were only crazy.

16:05.673 --> 16:06.715
You're also repulsive.

16:08.717 --> 16:10.219
Master Jang, do you

16:11.303 --> 16:14.723
still believe
all human lives are created equal?

16:14.807 --> 16:16.767
Why? Do you still believe otherwise?

16:16.850 --> 16:18.394
And what of Yoon Chae-ok?

16:21.897 --> 16:23.315
Do you feel the same way

16:24.274 --> 16:25.109
about her life?

16:33.492 --> 16:34.493
[moans]

16:38.539 --> 16:40.749
[sinister music playing]

16:54.221 --> 16:55.806
[Maeda] I have always wondered.

16:56.473 --> 16:59.018
If I were to suddenly
put your belief to the test,

16:59.101 --> 17:00.310
would it still hold?

17:01.937 --> 17:05.441
For example, what if we take
your friend in the hospital?

17:09.778 --> 17:11.697
[nurse] We'll be moving you
to the general ward.

17:12.197 --> 17:13.157
Huh?

17:13.240 --> 17:14.241
What about

17:15.367 --> 17:16.952
that captain friend of yours?

17:17.036 --> 17:19.038
[sinister music continues]

17:24.752 --> 17:25.586
[handle clicks]

17:26.211 --> 17:29.131
And the boy, number 71,
you've been looking for.

17:29.214 --> 17:32.468
If you were made to choose
between saving the lives of three

17:33.302 --> 17:35.387
or the life of one, who would you choose?

17:37.056 --> 17:38.724
Yoon Chae-ok or your three friends?

17:38.807 --> 17:40.142
No way.

17:41.226 --> 17:42.436
Please tell me you didn't.

17:55.991 --> 17:57.993
[distant snarling]

18:01.330 --> 18:03.248
[breathing heavily]

18:06.418 --> 18:08.420
[distant snarling]

18:09.963 --> 18:11.799
[distant growl]

18:13.175 --> 18:14.968
[Maeda] Yoon Chae-ok is not down there.

18:15.052 --> 18:19.807
Soon, she'll be inside a water tank
and her Najin removed.

18:21.809 --> 18:23.393
There are two options for her.

18:23.894 --> 18:25.646
She will either get to live

18:25.729 --> 18:28.357
but loses her memories
the same way you did.

18:29.650 --> 18:32.986
Option two, she never makes it
out of the water tank.

18:34.530 --> 18:35.781
She'll die drowning.

18:36.281 --> 18:37.282
[breathes nervously]

18:38.659 --> 18:39.493
Now,

18:40.494 --> 18:42.287
who will you save first, I wonder.

18:44.289 --> 18:45.374
Yoon Chae-ok?

18:46.375 --> 18:48.377
[tense music playing]

18:58.679 --> 18:59.596
Throw her in.

19:02.349 --> 19:03.183
[Maeda] Or…

19:05.060 --> 19:06.270
your three friends?

19:06.353 --> 19:07.688
[loud clanking]

19:08.564 --> 19:10.691
[low growling]

19:10.774 --> 19:12.317
[growls]

19:12.401 --> 19:13.986
[snarling]

19:14.069 --> 19:16.321
[Maeda] You need to choose, Master Jang.

19:17.281 --> 19:19.449
Time is running out, I'm afraid.

19:19.533 --> 19:21.910
Why do you always take it so far? Tell me!

19:21.994 --> 19:24.288
You're the one
who believes we're all equal.

19:25.330 --> 19:27.207
So I'm putting it to the test.

19:27.958 --> 19:29.710
An experiment of sorts.

19:29.793 --> 19:31.503
[stirring music playing]

19:31.587 --> 19:32.838
At the end of this,

19:33.338 --> 19:35.591
let's see if you will still believe

19:36.466 --> 19:37.885
we are all the same.

19:40.262 --> 19:41.221
I wonder

19:42.598 --> 19:43.974
if you'll change your mind.

20:03.035 --> 20:04.077
[gasps]

20:06.580 --> 20:08.749
- [mysterious music playing]
- [gasps, groans]

20:14.129 --> 20:15.339
Master Jang.

20:15.422 --> 20:17.049
[Maeda pants]

20:17.841 --> 20:19.843
[groans, pants]

20:20.594 --> 20:21.887
[screeching snarl]

20:21.970 --> 20:23.931
[tense music playing]

20:28.644 --> 20:30.145
[panting]

20:33.273 --> 20:34.107
[grunts]

20:36.443 --> 20:37.361
[coughs]

20:43.492 --> 20:44.743
[snarls]

20:45.452 --> 20:46.954
- [screeching howl]
- [gasps]

20:47.037 --> 20:49.331
Wake up! Come on. Please help us!

20:49.414 --> 20:51.625
[ferocious growl]

20:52.501 --> 20:53.877
[screeching snarl]

20:57.714 --> 20:59.591
[breathing heavily]

21:00.592 --> 21:01.885
[screeching snarl]

21:04.137 --> 21:05.097
[whimpers]

21:05.180 --> 21:06.056
[whimpers]

21:06.139 --> 21:07.933
[growling]

21:08.433 --> 21:09.518
[snarls]

21:10.018 --> 21:11.061
[screeching snarl]

21:20.862 --> 21:22.030
[creature growls]

21:22.114 --> 21:23.031
[whimpers]

21:32.582 --> 21:33.417
[gasps]

21:38.046 --> 21:39.006
[loud thud]

21:40.215 --> 21:41.216
[crackling]

21:43.468 --> 21:45.304
What are you doing? Don't come down.

21:46.471 --> 21:47.431
[crackling]

21:48.890 --> 21:49.975
[screeching snarl]

21:51.601 --> 21:53.478
[crackling]

21:53.562 --> 21:55.022
Ho-jae! What are you doing?

21:55.105 --> 21:56.690
Don't come down here! No!

21:56.773 --> 21:58.817
- [loud thudding]
- [grunts]

22:02.529 --> 22:04.072
[loud clattering]

22:04.156 --> 22:06.158
[tense music playing]

22:09.703 --> 22:10.954
[screeching snarl]

22:11.455 --> 22:12.497
[growls]

22:14.166 --> 22:15.208
[ferocious growl]

22:16.293 --> 22:18.170
[creature snarls]

22:18.962 --> 22:20.589
[breathing heavily]

22:22.924 --> 22:24.634
Hey! Are you crazy?

22:24.718 --> 22:27.220
I told you not to come down here.
What were you thinking?

22:36.063 --> 22:37.856
[rumbling snarl]

22:37.939 --> 22:39.107
I've done this before.

22:42.986 --> 22:44.654
[squelching]

22:44.738 --> 22:47.324
[snarling]

22:49.368 --> 22:51.161
[footsteps thudding]

22:51.244 --> 22:52.245
[snarls]

22:53.455 --> 22:55.999
[ferocious growling]

22:59.795 --> 23:01.088
- [Chae-ok groans]
- Just give up.

23:01.171 --> 23:03.048
[breathing nervously]

23:03.131 --> 23:04.716
There's no way out for you.

23:06.551 --> 23:08.220
Where is Master Jang?

23:11.306 --> 23:12.808
Just tell me that, at least.

23:13.350 --> 23:14.643
[breathes heavily]

23:15.811 --> 23:16.728
[grunts]

23:17.521 --> 23:18.563
[groans]

23:18.647 --> 23:19.981
Is he still alive?

23:23.151 --> 23:26.571
[Kuroko01] He is alive, but it will be
hard for you to see him again.

23:34.704 --> 23:38.542
Jang Tae-sang could have chosen
to save you, but he opted to save others.

23:41.253 --> 23:43.004
And because of his decision,

23:44.214 --> 23:45.632
he won't make it out alive.

23:45.715 --> 23:47.342
He'll be ripped to shreds soon.

23:53.140 --> 23:55.392
As for you, you will die
in this water tank.

23:58.311 --> 24:01.481
If you wanted to win, you both
should have ran while you had the chance.

24:01.565 --> 24:04.443
You make decisions
based on emotions rather than logic.

24:04.526 --> 24:06.903
It's no wonder
you don't accomplish anything.

24:06.987 --> 24:08.989
[pensive music playing]

24:09.823 --> 24:13.034
Just as we have
our own reason for choosing to live…

24:14.619 --> 24:15.662
[breathes shakily]

24:18.290 --> 24:21.626
…we both have our reasons
for choosing to die for each other.

24:23.670 --> 24:25.213
Are you not afraid of death?

24:35.474 --> 24:37.476
[music grows]

24:43.356 --> 24:45.901
What I fear most is far worse than death.

24:55.285 --> 24:58.246
What is worse
than being alone and unable to die?

25:11.718 --> 25:13.386
It's a pity, those eyes.

25:18.391 --> 25:19.643
What beautiful eyes.

25:23.480 --> 25:25.690
[dramatic music playing]

25:25.774 --> 25:28.068
[gasping]

25:29.152 --> 25:30.570
[ferocious growling]

25:32.572 --> 25:33.740
[grunts]

25:39.621 --> 25:40.539
[snarling]

25:43.583 --> 25:45.460
What the heck? What is that?

25:45.544 --> 25:46.628
What the heck is that?

25:46.711 --> 25:48.296
Can you shut up for a second? Seriously!

25:49.130 --> 25:50.590
[snarling]

25:52.425 --> 25:53.468
Ho-jae!

25:54.970 --> 25:57.264
[rumbling growl]

25:57.347 --> 25:58.515
[Yong-gil] Hey! Ho-jae!

25:59.182 --> 26:00.225
[gasping]

26:00.308 --> 26:01.601
Ho-jae, are you okay?

26:04.187 --> 26:06.523
[rumbling growl]

26:07.357 --> 26:09.067
Go away. Oh shit! Wait, wait!

26:09.150 --> 26:11.361
Go away! Get away from us! [screams]

26:11.444 --> 26:13.446
- [squelching]
- [ferocious snarl]

26:13.530 --> 26:15.073
Come on! Get outta here!

26:15.156 --> 26:16.575
Hurry and cut them off.

26:16.658 --> 26:17.951
Hurry, Yong-gil.

26:18.535 --> 26:19.661
Oh shit!

26:20.453 --> 26:21.830
My leg. My leg.

26:25.750 --> 26:27.002
[panting]

26:27.085 --> 26:27.919
Goddamn it.

26:28.712 --> 26:31.214
Over there. Jong-hyeok.
We gotta get him. He comes with us.

26:31.298 --> 26:32.382
Hurry, we have to hurry.

26:32.465 --> 26:33.425
[creature snarls]

26:35.093 --> 26:36.886
- Hurry. Faster!
- [creature snarls]

26:37.470 --> 26:38.513
You're free. Untie it.

26:40.807 --> 26:41.808
[grunts]

26:41.891 --> 26:42.726
Ho-jae!

26:42.809 --> 26:45.687
There's an elevator!
Back there! Hurry up! Go!

26:47.105 --> 26:48.023
Ah shit!

26:52.319 --> 26:53.820
[ferocious growling]

26:53.903 --> 26:55.864
[loud clattering]

26:57.490 --> 26:58.450
[snarls]

26:58.533 --> 26:59.701
Hurry up! Get outta here!

27:01.870 --> 27:02.954
Come on! Hurry up!

27:03.455 --> 27:05.332
[melancholy music playing]

27:06.791 --> 27:07.917
[footstep thuds]

27:09.127 --> 27:10.337
[footstep thuds]

27:12.213 --> 27:13.214
[creature snarls]

27:13.798 --> 27:15.175
[creature growls]

27:16.343 --> 27:18.345
[unsettling music playing]

27:23.099 --> 27:25.769
[growling]

27:33.943 --> 27:35.945
[tense music playing]

27:43.578 --> 27:45.622
[Kuroko04] How low
should I set the temperature?

27:45.705 --> 27:47.415
Bring it down to 18 degrees.

28:07.727 --> 28:08.853
[growls]

28:11.564 --> 28:13.566
[dramatic music playing]

28:14.234 --> 28:16.319
[snarling]

28:17.195 --> 28:18.279
[grunts]

28:22.283 --> 28:23.410
[grunts]

28:24.202 --> 28:25.495
[growls]

28:26.454 --> 28:27.664
[pained howl]

28:28.164 --> 28:29.457
[snarls]

28:29.541 --> 28:31.251
[knife clatters]

28:32.293 --> 28:34.087
- [growls]
- [concrete crumbling]

28:36.756 --> 28:38.883
[panting]

28:42.512 --> 28:43.888
[snarling]

28:49.269 --> 28:50.311
[grunts]

28:54.107 --> 28:56.109
[squelching]

28:57.819 --> 28:58.903
[grunts]

29:15.920 --> 29:18.506
[ferocious growling]

29:22.677 --> 29:23.678
[creature snarls]

29:26.139 --> 29:28.141
[creature growling]

29:28.224 --> 29:29.726
[music subsides]

29:30.518 --> 29:32.145
[creature growls]

29:34.481 --> 29:35.607
Stop right there.

29:38.359 --> 29:41.905
[snarling]

29:43.031 --> 29:45.366
[Tae-sang] I know you're in pain.
I understand.

29:45.950 --> 29:48.578
[panting]

29:49.704 --> 29:52.248
[creature's breathing slows]

30:01.758 --> 30:03.259
[footstep thuds]

30:04.969 --> 30:06.304
[footstep thuds]

30:07.972 --> 30:09.182
[distant thud]

30:10.642 --> 30:11.601
[distant thud]

30:16.648 --> 30:17.482
[alarm sounds]

30:17.565 --> 30:20.026
[woman's voice] Nitrogen gas
has been detected.

30:20.109 --> 30:21.820
- Please evacuate immediately.
- [gas hissing]

30:21.903 --> 30:23.071
[snarling]

30:24.405 --> 30:25.990
[alarm continues]

30:26.908 --> 30:29.077
[woman's voice] Nitrogen gas
has been detected.

30:30.995 --> 30:32.413
Look, it's here! It's here!

30:35.875 --> 30:38.086
[woman's voice] Nitrogen gas
has been detected.

30:39.045 --> 30:40.338
Ho-jae! Come on! Hurry!

30:42.173 --> 30:43.800
What the hell is he doing?

30:43.883 --> 30:45.969
- Nitrogen gas has been detected.
- Oh!

30:47.512 --> 30:49.055
Hold on. Ho-jae!

30:49.138 --> 30:50.306
Ho-jae!

30:51.140 --> 30:52.225
Ho-jae!

30:53.393 --> 30:54.644
[snarls]

30:54.727 --> 30:55.812
[growls]

30:58.773 --> 30:59.858
[pained groan]

31:01.234 --> 31:02.861
[hopeful music playing]

31:08.199 --> 31:09.826
[music soars]

31:22.505 --> 31:23.339
[grunts]

31:25.258 --> 31:26.634
[exhales sharply]

31:27.510 --> 31:29.304
[straining]

31:39.439 --> 31:40.523
[groans]

31:41.900 --> 31:42.734
[grunts]

31:45.320 --> 31:47.322
[doors clattering]

31:51.409 --> 31:52.493
Are you all right?

31:53.620 --> 31:54.913
[Yong-gil] Ho-jae! Ho-jae!

31:54.996 --> 31:56.998
I was worried. Are you okay?

31:57.749 --> 31:59.459
Yong-gil, there's no time to talk.

31:59.542 --> 32:01.836
Go up a floor and follow the long hallway
all the way down.

32:01.920 --> 32:03.504
Once you get to the very end of the hall,

32:03.588 --> 32:06.591
you'll come across very big iron doors
that'll be on your right side.

32:06.674 --> 32:08.760
Keep going, and follow that pathway
until you get out.

32:08.843 --> 32:10.970
Wait a minute. Hey, what about you?

32:11.054 --> 32:12.805
Yoon Chae-ok is still in here.

32:12.889 --> 32:16.309
Don't do this. You can't go alone.
It's not safe out there!

32:18.186 --> 32:19.938
Call the police as soon as you're outside.

32:20.563 --> 32:21.481
Yeah, I will.

32:21.564 --> 32:22.398
Ho-Jae, listen.

32:23.066 --> 32:26.027
Just come with us, okay?
Okay? Let's get out together.

32:26.611 --> 32:29.113
You gotta save yourself!
Don't risk it for her!

32:29.197 --> 32:30.239
[chuckles softly]

32:32.283 --> 32:33.576
I'm staying, Yong-gil.

32:34.410 --> 32:35.578
I have to find Chae-ok.

32:35.662 --> 32:37.664
[wistful music playing]

32:44.128 --> 32:46.506
[doors clatter]

33:31.926 --> 33:32.927
[gasps softly]

33:43.354 --> 33:45.356
[wistful music continues]

33:51.195 --> 33:52.321
How is it progressing?

33:52.989 --> 33:56.492
[Kuroko04] The water temperature
inside the tank dropped to 20 degrees.

33:56.576 --> 33:58.619
In about two, three minutes, it'll hit 18.

33:59.370 --> 34:01.873
Then soon, she'll suffer cardiac arrest.

34:08.337 --> 34:09.672
[Chae-ok] Master Jang.

34:12.341 --> 34:14.052
I wish I could go to you.

34:17.138 --> 34:18.639
There are so many things

34:20.516 --> 34:22.060
I've wanted to tell you.

34:24.562 --> 34:26.105
And so many things…

34:28.566 --> 34:30.109
I hoped to do together.

34:37.700 --> 34:39.702
[squelching]

35:01.099 --> 35:02.016
What's going on?

35:05.144 --> 35:06.562
Her Najin should be asleep.

35:19.867 --> 35:21.285
[music fades]

35:33.131 --> 35:34.215
Why did you do it?

35:36.050 --> 35:36.968
To kill me?

35:39.178 --> 35:40.596
Was that your intention?

35:44.142 --> 35:45.977
I should've killed you a year ago

35:47.395 --> 35:48.771
when you had chosen

35:50.314 --> 35:52.316
Jang Tae-sang instead of me.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.442
[scoffs]

35:57.905 --> 35:59.490
I'll ask one last question.

36:03.953 --> 36:05.955
Did you ever see me as your son?

36:06.038 --> 36:07.707
[pensive music playing]

36:08.583 --> 36:10.793
That side of you is your weakness.

36:12.336 --> 36:16.132
Have you still learned nothing,
dearest Seung-jo?

36:17.842 --> 36:21.679
This obsession over trivial relationships
is like a prison to humans.

36:22.597 --> 36:24.515
It turns them into vulnerable

36:25.516 --> 36:27.101
and useless beings.

36:28.644 --> 36:33.024
They get taken advantage of
and become expendable or easily discarded.

36:34.942 --> 36:38.487
And I did not… raise you that way.

36:40.198 --> 36:42.575
I raised you to not have attachments.

36:42.658 --> 36:44.452
To ignore your human weakness

36:44.535 --> 36:47.705
so that you would
become perfect on your own.

36:50.541 --> 36:52.418
Instead, you longed for a mother

36:53.294 --> 36:55.213
and relied on Jang Tae-sang.

36:57.757 --> 36:59.008
How disappointing.

37:07.391 --> 37:08.392
[sighs]

37:15.566 --> 37:16.692
I apologize.

37:21.864 --> 37:23.241
The fact that you were…

37:25.243 --> 37:27.495
disappointed means you had expectations.

37:29.330 --> 37:30.373
So from now on,

37:31.707 --> 37:32.792
I will work harder.

37:34.669 --> 37:36.170
I won't have attachments…

37:38.172 --> 37:39.257
or rely on anyone.

37:40.258 --> 37:41.133
With that said…

37:41.801 --> 37:42.843
[squelching]

37:42.927 --> 37:44.637
[dramatic string music playing]

37:47.139 --> 37:47.974
[coughs]

37:50.434 --> 37:51.894
…it's time I leave the nest.

37:54.855 --> 37:56.482
I won't be held down by you.

37:59.527 --> 38:01.320
This is the monster you raised.

38:03.322 --> 38:04.198
[Maeda gasps]

38:05.574 --> 38:06.575
[groans]

38:06.659 --> 38:08.494
[Maeda groans, grunts]

38:09.787 --> 38:11.706
[unsettling music playing]

38:11.789 --> 38:13.040
[grunts, gasps]

38:16.210 --> 38:17.878
[gunshots]

38:20.506 --> 38:22.508
[both grunting]

38:25.386 --> 38:26.887
[breathing heavily]

38:28.514 --> 38:30.266
[screaming]

38:33.477 --> 38:35.229
[music fades]

38:40.443 --> 38:42.695
[panting]

38:45.656 --> 38:46.657
[gasps]

39:01.589 --> 39:02.506
[moans]

39:05.801 --> 39:07.803
[gentle music playing]

39:10.931 --> 39:12.767
[skin sizzling]

39:20.232 --> 39:21.150
[gasps softly]

39:32.078 --> 39:33.329
It's so lovely.

39:35.790 --> 39:36.832
[sighs]

40:04.235 --> 40:05.820
[gentle music continues]

40:05.903 --> 40:07.238
[Kuroko04] Her heart has stopped.

40:24.588 --> 40:26.799
[music intensifies]

40:52.199 --> 40:53.951
I'll be taking that Najin.

41:02.710 --> 41:04.712
[music soars]

41:16.223 --> 41:17.641
[grunting]

41:22.980 --> 41:24.982
[grunting]

41:30.279 --> 41:31.280
[body thuds]

41:44.835 --> 41:45.669
[screams]

41:47.338 --> 41:48.756
[grunting]

41:53.302 --> 41:55.137
[panting]

42:03.812 --> 42:04.939
[Chae-ok] Do you think

42:05.814 --> 42:06.941
that the good times

42:08.067 --> 42:09.485
will come to us as well?

42:12.738 --> 42:14.323
[Tae-sang] They will, without a doubt.

42:23.415 --> 42:26.210
I'll make sure… they do.

42:41.976 --> 42:43.143
[music fades]

42:43.769 --> 42:44.770
[Myung-jun grunts]

42:46.480 --> 42:49.066
[sirens wailing]

42:55.823 --> 42:56.782
What?

42:56.865 --> 42:57.992
[sirens stop]

42:58.742 --> 43:00.202
What will happen to me now?

43:00.786 --> 43:01.620
Well,

43:02.288 --> 43:04.123
you have to face the consequences.

43:05.082 --> 43:06.709
There were three people killed.

43:08.961 --> 43:09.962
I'll help you.

43:10.546 --> 43:13.549
We'll get you qualified
for mitigating factors, so don't

43:14.216 --> 43:15.050
worry too much.

43:15.134 --> 43:16.719
[car doors closing]

43:18.512 --> 43:19.722
[Park] Move, move, move!

43:19.805 --> 43:22.141
Over here. [exhales sharply]

43:22.224 --> 43:23.267
[Ji-su gasps]

43:23.350 --> 43:24.393
- Captain Yuh!
- Hi.

43:25.394 --> 43:27.104
- Are you all right?
- I'm fine, I'm fine.

43:27.187 --> 43:29.148
[Ji-su] How badly are you injured?
Can you move?

43:29.231 --> 43:31.692
- [groans] I think I broke my leg.
- [officer] Move, move!

43:32.276 --> 43:35.362
Listen. We need to get
an emergency warrant.

43:35.446 --> 43:37.406
- Okay.
- For Jeonseung Biotech, all right?

43:37.489 --> 43:38.907
- I'll see to it, sir.
- Oh shit.

43:39.825 --> 43:41.368
- Are you all right?
- [groans]

43:42.995 --> 43:44.496
Are you the only ones who made it out?

43:53.005 --> 43:53.839
What was that?

43:53.922 --> 43:55.799
Are you the only ones who made it?

44:00.596 --> 44:01.513
Yeah.

44:02.181 --> 44:03.223
There's no one else.

44:03.307 --> 44:04.433
Ah. Okay.

44:08.228 --> 44:09.772
[panting]

44:57.361 --> 44:59.279
[woman's voice] The doors are opening.

45:03.617 --> 45:06.412
SEARCH AND SEIZURE CONDUCTED
AGAINST JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

45:06.495 --> 45:08.580
INVESTIGATION INTO
ILLEGAL HUMAN EXPERIMENTATION

45:08.664 --> 45:10.624
MULTIPLE TIP-OFFS OF HUMAN EXPERIMENTATION

45:10.708 --> 45:12.084
PROSECUTION SUMMONS CHAIRMAN

45:12.167 --> 45:13.794
HUMAN EXPERIMENTATION LAB NOT FOUND

45:16.588 --> 45:19.216
[dog barking]

45:24.304 --> 45:25.222
Oh, that's good.

45:32.688 --> 45:33.689
[dishes clatter]

46:05.721 --> 46:07.055
[hums]

46:36.877 --> 46:39.171
[grandma] Come on out and eat.
You're going to be late.

46:39.671 --> 46:40.547
Okay!

46:42.216 --> 46:43.342
I'm here. I'm here.

46:44.134 --> 46:44.968
[exhales]

46:45.719 --> 46:46.678
[sighs]

46:47.429 --> 46:49.431
Is school going to end late again today?

46:49.932 --> 46:53.101
Uh, we're having a fundraiser
for a club that I'm in,

46:53.185 --> 46:54.895
then we might go out.

46:55.521 --> 46:56.772
I'll be out pretty late, yeah.

46:56.855 --> 46:57.856
[grandma] Mmm.

46:58.774 --> 47:00.609
Yum. Oh, I love it.

47:00.692 --> 47:02.277
- Yummy, right? [laughs]
- Yeah.

47:07.783 --> 47:10.536
So… any boys you wanna go out with?

47:12.287 --> 47:14.498
Um, actually, uh…

47:15.958 --> 47:16.917
Mm…

47:17.584 --> 47:19.127
So…

47:21.588 --> 47:22.840
Eventually, I guess.

47:22.923 --> 47:24.716
[both laughing]

47:28.053 --> 47:30.097
Here. Have some meat too.

47:34.309 --> 47:36.603
Mmm. It's so good. Mmm.

47:36.687 --> 47:38.438
[gentle piano music playing]

47:39.189 --> 47:40.482
Your makeup looks good.

47:41.275 --> 47:43.277
There'll be some boys at the fundraiser.

47:44.152 --> 47:46.196
And your outfit looks so good too.
Goodness.

47:46.280 --> 47:48.323
Something new for once, you know?

47:48.407 --> 47:51.535
[Chae-ok] Sometimes… I have this dream.

47:51.618 --> 47:52.828
[indistinct chatter]

47:53.579 --> 47:55.581
[gentle piano music continues]

47:58.166 --> 48:01.336
[Chae-ok] A dream where
I chase after someone every night.

48:03.714 --> 48:05.299
But I don't know who it is,

48:06.216 --> 48:08.176
nor can I remember what he looks like.

48:09.970 --> 48:13.640
But by the time I wake up,
my heart aches and yearns for him.

48:15.767 --> 48:17.477
Yet spring will soon pass,

48:18.979 --> 48:20.647
and summer will come again.

48:20.731 --> 48:22.190
[music fades]

49:13.200 --> 49:18.538
♪ Candles lit in the room ♪

49:19.206 --> 49:24.336
♪ Wind from the chink swayed by it ♪

49:25.295 --> 49:28.256
♪ It's like my mind ♪

49:28.340 --> 49:31.051
♪ It's just like me ♪

49:31.134 --> 49:35.764
♪ Staring for long time ♪

49:37.182 --> 49:42.020
♪ Where the wind came from? ♪

49:43.146 --> 49:48.276
♪ Went out through the door ♪

49:49.236 --> 49:53.657
♪ Ah… ♪

49:55.492 --> 49:58.578
[Tae-sang] And we will… be together again.

50:09.840 --> 50:15.637
♪ Will it come when winter's gone? ♪

50:16.179 --> 50:22.769
♪ Will it come when spring comes? ♪

50:23.270 --> 50:27.691
♪ Before the cherry blossoms fall ♪

50:28.191 --> 50:33.238
♪ Melting the painful times ♪

50:34.197 --> 50:39.369
♪ Hmm, mm, mm ♪

51:09.816 --> 51:15.447
♪ Will it come when winter's gone? ♪

51:16.239 --> 51:22.829
♪ Will it come when spring comes? ♪

51:23.330 --> 51:27.667
♪ Before the cherry blossoms fall ♪

51:28.210 --> 51:33.215
♪ Melting the painful times ♪

51:34.216 --> 51:39.471
♪ Hmm, mm, mm ♪

51:49.314 --> 51:52.192
♪ Ooh ♪

51:52.275 --> 51:55.195
♪ Ooh ♪

51:55.278 --> 51:58.073
♪ Ooh ♪

51:58.156 --> 52:00.033
♪ Ooh ♪

52:05.205 --> 52:09.209
IN REMEMBRANCE OF OUR COLLEAGUES
KIM HYEON-JUNG AND OH HYO-JEONG

52:10.293 --> 52:11.545
[music fades]

52:11.628 --> 52:13.630
[stirring music playing]

52:34.609 --> 52:35.569
[clears throat]

52:39.906 --> 52:41.158
Please continue on.

52:53.712 --> 52:55.714
[music intensifies]

53:27.537 --> 53:28.997
[music soars]

53:47.891 --> 53:49.476
[music subsides]

54:22.092 --> 54:24.094
[music fades]
